{'symbol': 'EQT', 'date': '2021-02-11 09:49:00', 'title': "INVESTOR ALERT: SCOTT+SCOTT ATTORNEYS AT LAW LLP CONTINUES INVESTIGATING EQT CORPORATION'S DIRECTORS AND OFFICERS FOR BREACH OF FIDUCIARY DUTIES – EQT", 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 11, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- SCOTT+SCOTT ATTORNEYS AT LAW LLP (“SCOTT+SCOTT”), AN INTERNATIONAL SECURITIES AND CONSUMER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, CONTINUES INVESTIGATING CERTAIN DIRECTORS AND OFFICERS OF EQT CORPORATION (“EQT” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: EQT) FOR BREACHING THEIR FIDUCIARY DUTIES TO THE COMPANY AND ITS SHAREHOLDERS. IF YOU ARE AN EQT SHAREHOLDER, YOU MAY CONTACT ATTORNEY JOE PETTIGREW FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION AT 844-818-6982 OR JPETTIGREW@SCOTT-SCOTT.COM .'}